    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        curated re-elevation (exact_match): Source X3492 = victim of earthquake (ext of X34) +
        unspecified place + work. Target 44784554 SNOMED CT 698720003 (std=S) is the X34 crosswalk target.
